/usr/bin/python3 -I -B -m unittest discover '"\\
  -s 08_experiments/E5_codemut -p 'test_*.py' -v
bash -n 08_experiments/E5_codemut/run_pair.sh
bash -n 08_experiments/E5_codemut/analyse_pair.sh
"'```

